OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786627119
OL,3,CMan fined for dumping mattress and
OL,4,Cwashing machine on country lane in
OL,5,CAndover
OL,7,FA man who dumped a selection of large
OL,8,Fhousehold items in Andover in
OL,9,FHampshire has been fined more than
OL,10,F#1300 for fly-tipping.
OL,12,FBroken furniture, a mattress and a
OL,13,Ffridge freezer were found abandoned in
OL,14,FPasture Walk on 4 and 5 of August last
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FAn investigation was launched by Test
OL,18,FValley Borough Council, and found
OL,19,FJoshua Scarlett who lived at a nearby
OL,20,Fproperty had left the waste outside to
OL,21,Fbe collected but it wasn't removed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
