OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786627119
OL,3,CMan fined for dumping mattress and
OL,4,Cwashing machine on country lane in
OL,5,CAndover
OL,7,FOn 24 July 2026 at Southampton
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court, Mr Scarlett was
OL,9,Ffined #425 and ordered to pay #947 in
OL,10,Fcosts.
OL,12,FCouncillor David Drew, portfolio
OL,13,Fholder for recycling and environmental
OL,14,Fservices at Test Valley Borough
OL,15,FCouncil, said: "Everyone has a legal
OL,16,Fresponsibility to make sure their
OL,17,Fwaste is disposed of properly.
OL,26,@wD@POU
