OL,3,CMan fined for dumping mattress and
OL,4,Cwashing machine on country lane in
OL,5,CAndover
OL,7,F"If you pay someone to take away your
OL,8,Frubbish, it's important to check they
OL,9,Fare authorised to do so and that your
OL,10,Fwaste reaches a legitimate disposal
OL,11,Fsite.
OL,13,F"We will continue to investigate
OL,14,Fincidents of illegal waste disposal
OL,15,Fand take enforcement action where
OL,16,Fappropriate."
